Crossfeed Chat
Copyright (c) 2026 Anneo22

Crossfeed Chat is a small redesign of the ChatGPT gateway in PiLink, created
by Rocco Angelella and the PiLink contributors:
https://github.com/roccoangelella/PiLink

Its gateway_exchange protocol, paired OAuth approval flow, and validation
rules derive from PiLink. The Chat/Work check in extension/page.ts adapts PiLink's
browser-extension/chat-mode.js; the fresh-chat wake sequence follows PiLink's worker launcher. PiLink's MIT copyright and
permission notice are retained below. The optional src/wake-focus.ts KWin
restoration script and its short-lived DBus preparation adapt PiLink's
src/llm-gateway-kwin-focus.ts, also under the PiLink MIT terms below.

